«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  TTestPArgs
  @  Labels a row of values with the parameter names of TTestP.
  @  Author & design           : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "TTestPArgs: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → nv dbv sdv « nv 0 + dbv 0 + sdv 0 + → nn dbar sdd « nn "n" →Tag dbar "dbar" →Tag sdd "sd" →Tag nv dbv sdv 3 →List Drop » »
»
